//BRACERS OF DEFENSE AC 7 - 3000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BRAC02.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Bracers"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Bracers are thick bands of metal or leather that are strapped, belted, or tied to a character's forearm.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Bracers of Defense AC 7"
	SAY DESC "Crafted from premium, supple leather and lined with fine metal accents, these lightweight armguards are subtly reinforced with a basic warding enchantment. They set the user's base Armor Class to 7, offering an elegant and comfortable upgrade for wealthy individuals who refuse the bulk of traditional armor.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Armor Class: 7

Weight: 2"



