//BRACERS OF ARCHERY - 4000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BRAC04.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Bracers"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Bracers are thick bands of metal or leather that are strapped, belted, or tied to a character's forearm.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Bracers of Archery"
	SAY DESC "During a dangerous meeting with a rival ruler, the king of the Great Dale requested the protection of his best Archers in addition to his usual guard. The Archers, each equipped with an enchanted bow and bracers, hid within range of the gathering. As predicted, enemy troops attempted to seize the king and force their will over his rule, but none had anticipated the amazing accuracy and lethality of the hidden Archers. The king was able to escape unharmed; in fact, none of the ambush members even lived to approach him. 

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– THAC0: +2 with missile weapons
- Damage: +1 with missile weapons

Weight: 2"





//GAUNTLETS OF OGRE POWER - 7000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BRAC06.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Gauntlets"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Gauntlets are armored gloves. They can be made of leather, metal plates, or chain mail. Every suit of armor is assumed to include gauntlets of an appropriate type. Magical gauntlets tend to be finer, lighter, and more easily worn than normal varieties.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Gauntlets of Ogre Power"
	SAY DESC "Gauntlets of Ogre Power, also know as The Hands of Takkok are exactly that: his very hands. He lost them when he attacked a strange man crossing the Spine of the World. The mysterious man turned out to be a mage of incredible power, and he used Takkok's hands to create this pair of ogre skin gauntlets.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Strength: 18/00

Weight: 2"




