	SAY NAME2 "Gauntlets of Dexterity"
	SAY DESC "This pair of gauntlets was likely developed in Kara-Tur to aid masters of the martial arts. Legends speak of such masters from the Far East bringing these items with them on their journeys, though details remain sketchy. 

