	SAY NAME1 SAY NAME1 "Gauntlets"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Gauntlets are armored gloves. They can be made of leather, metal plates, or chain mail. Every suit of armor is assumed to include gauntlets of an appropriate type. Magical gauntlets tend to be finer, lighter, and more easily worn than normal varieties.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Gauntlets of Undead Control"
	SAY DESC "These powerful gauntlets were created by the clerics of Myrkul in Kagarr, who were intent on controlling an undead horde that was destabilizing the region. The gauntlets draw their power from the wearer's sanity, completely detaching them from reality while granting them the ability to empathize with the undead.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Wisdom: -2 penalty
- Turn Undead: +4 cleric level

Weight: 2"




//GLOVES OF PICKPOCKETING - 2500mo - no buoni//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BRAC17.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 SAY NAME1 "Gauntlets"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Gauntlets are armored gloves. They can be made of leather, metal plates, or chain mail. Every suit of armor is assumed to include gauntlets of an appropriate type. Magical gauntlets tend to be finer, lighter, and more easily worn than normal varieties.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Gloves of Pickpocketing"
	SAY DESC "A few years back, Fong Moo, a famous cutpurse known in both Baldur's Gate and Athkatla, was found dead on the road between the Gate and Beregost. Seems he'd stolen an artifact from a powerful mage and tried escaping, with little success. His possessions went to a nephew, who took up the same trade as his uncle and became especially good at pickpocketing. Whether these gloves were magical before falling into Fong's hands or if they are somehow imbued with the master's essence is not known.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Pick Pockets: +25%

Weight: 2"





//GLOVES OF PERSEVERANCE - 3500mo - solo chierici e paladini - no malvagi//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BDBRAC15.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 SAY NAME1 "Gauntlets"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Gauntlets are armored gloves. They can be made of leather, metal plates, or chain mail. Every suit of armor is assumed to include gauntlets of an appropriate type. Magical gauntlets tend to be finer, lighter, and more easily worn than normal varieties.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Gloves of Perseverance"
	SAY DESC "These storied bracers were once worn by High Cleric Kaelen the Unbroken during the Siege of the Dead Fields. Surrounded by a tide of fiends and plagued by sheer exhaustion, Kaelen missed a decisive strike that should have sealed his doom. Yet, his faith never wavered; in that moment of failure, the bracers flared with divine light, granting him the strength to endure and turn the tide of battle. The metal still carries the echo of his resilience, shielding holy warriors when their own strength falters.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– When the wearer suffers a critical miss, <PRO_HESHE> is affected by the Aid spell

Weight: 2"








GAUNTLETS OF THE DUELLIST - 1500mo - no maghi, chierici e druidi //
