	SAY DESC "Forged in the holy fires of Mount Celestia, these heavy platinum bracers were once worn by Sir Gareth the Undaunted, a legendary holy warrior who single-handedly defended a mountain pass against a horde of fiends. Imbued with the unwavering righteousness of the Triad, the bracers pulse with a warm, comforting light. Only those who have sworn the sacred oaths of the paladin can channel the true power trapped within the metal. In the hands of the pure, these bracers strike absolute terror into the hearts of evil beings.

