//GAUNTLETS OF WAR ALACRITY - solo combattenti - 12000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BRAC21.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Bracers"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Gauntlets are armored gloves. They can be made of leather, metal plates, or chain mail. Every suit of armor is assumed to include gauntlets of an appropriate type. Magical gauntlets tend to be finer, lighter, and more easily worn than normal varieties.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Gauntlets of War Alacrity"
	SAY DESC "These jagged, abyssal leather gauntlets once belonged to Vorash-Kha, a terrifying anomaly known in the Blood War as the Marilith King. Born from the shattered soul of a tyrannical warlord, Vorash-Kha ruled the abyssal trenches with six arms that moved in perfect, lethal synchronization. It is said these gauntlets were forged from the very scales he shed during his bloody ascension. When slipped onto a mortal's hands, the residual essence of the demon king infuses the wearer's muscles, granting them the precise, terrifying reflexes of a multi-armed master of blades.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Speed factor: +4
- 1/2 extra attack per round

Weight: 2"